 "response": {
  "text": "If your budget is **under ₹2,000**, I’d rank the brands like this:\n\n1. **Levi’s — best overall** ⭐  \n   You can currently find Levi’s 513/512/505 styles around **₹1,263–₹1,975** on Levi’s India. The **513 Slim Straight** is especially good if you want a versatile, not-too-tight fit. [levi.in](https://levi.in/collections/men-jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[levi.in](https://levi.in/collections/mens-jeans-sale?utm_source=chatgpt.com)  \n   ### [Levi's 513 Slim Men Blue Jeans]()\n*₹1,263*\n\n2. **Pepe Jeans — best value/premium feel**  \n   Pepe currently has several men's jeans around **₹1,449–₹1,999**, including straight and slim fits. [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/men/jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)  \n   ### [Pepe Jeans Men's Holborne Mid Rise Straight Jeans]()\n*₹1,359.15*\n\n3. **Flying Machine — best budget choice**  \n   Good if you want to spend **₹1,000–₹1,500** rather than the full ₹2,000. Current listings show styles around ₹1,099–₹1,897. [www.flipkart.com](https://www.flipkart.com/mens-jeans/flying-machine~brand/pr?sid=clo%2Cvua%2Ck58%2Ci51&utm_source=chatgpt.com)  \n   ### [Flying Machine Men's Jackson Skinny Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,099*\n\n4. **H&M — best for a modern/fashionable fit**  \n   Men's jeans are currently available around **₹1,499–₹1,999**. ### [H&M Men's Slim Jeans]()\n*₹1,499*\n\n5. **Snitch — best for trendy styles**  \n   Current options include slim/stretch jeans around **₹1,599–₹1,799**. ### [Snitch Men's Slim Fit Stretch Jeans]()\n*₹1,799*\n\n### My pick\n**Buy Levi’s if you find a 513 or 512 for ₹1,300–₹1,900.** That's probably the strongest combination of **fit, durability and brand quality** at this budget. Levi’s currently has a dedicated sale selection with many men's jeans below ₹1,699. [levi.in](https://levi.in/collections/men-jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[levi.in](https://levi.in/collections/mens-jeans-sale?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you tell me your **age, waist size, height, body type (slim/average/heavy), and whether you prefer slim/straight/loose**, I can pick **3 specific jeans under ₹2,000** for you.",
